                "title": "Camelot Single Cylinder Deadbolt, Schlage B60CAM",
                "description": "Schlage B60CAM, Camelot Single Cylinder Deadbolt - Finally a high-security deadbolt that looks as good as it functions. The Schlage made Camelot Deadbolt is a single cylinder lock, which means the bolt is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior. It has an adjustable latch to fit 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets; and it will fit door thicknesses ranging from 1-3/8 inches up to 2-3/4 inches. The Camelot Single Cylinder Deadbolt has a contemporary style that is very now, perfect for home updates and new-builds alike.\r\n",
